From: Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>
Subject: Relax uv_build upper bound for newer toolchains

Upstream pins uv_build>=0.9.26,<0.10.0, but Factory ships 0.13.x and
upstream's own release workflow already builds with uv 0.13.6.
Keep only the floor.

---
 pyproject.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -36,1 +36,1 @@
-requires = ["uv_build>=0.9.26,<0.10.0"]
+requires = ["uv_build>=0.9.26"]
